# Gitignored files `wt step copy-ignored` may copy into a new worktree.
#
# Kept intentionally minimal: the pre-start hook in .config/wt.toml already
# materializes .env, so nothing here is required for a build. Only add content
# that is expensive to regenerate AND safe to copy verbatim.
#
# Never add: .sconsign.dblite (per-worktree signature DB), *.obj / object trees,
# build/ (owned by the gdextest fixture), project/headless_tests/**/out/
# (multi-GB test output), or .cache/scons (the shared object cache).
.env
